      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54400210020BA54B354B2940020BA54B354C778B370000AAC00B77CB974C9C0BC29C5D0C11C0020C7A1C7400020B140C11DC774B77C00100001BE00000AC774B7F00020BAA8C2B5C7440020D558ACE00020C788C5B4002E001000020114014C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "땅속에 숨어 있으면\n마치 몬스터볼 같아 보이지.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B545C18DC5D00020C228C5B40020C788C73CBA74000AB9C8CE580020BAACC2A4D130BCFC0020AC19C5440020BCF4C774C9C0002E001000020114014C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "11번 와일드 존에서\n메더를 찾아 주지 않을래?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n분명 몬스터볼로 위장하고 있을 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00310031BC880020C640C77CB4DC0020C874C5D0C11C000ABA54B354B97C0020CC3EC5440020C8FCC9C00020C54AC744B798003F00100001BE00000ABD84BA850020BAACC2A4D130BCFCB85C0020C704C7A5D558ACE00020C788C7440020AC70C57C002E001000020114014C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
